    j = j + "    \"L2: timing is measured on a SINGLE calibration (base=" + to_string(_base()) + ", coupling=" + to_string(_coupling()) + ", q_thr=" + to_string(_q_thr()) + ", radius=" + to_string(_radius()) + "). Onset-latency ordering and front speed are calibration-dependent: a higher base would let cells reach up_thr without the boost (no quorum-gate), and a larger radius would shrink the front-propagation regime toward an instantaneous global flip.\",\n"
